7. Case Service: switches plot from Area Mode to Precision Mode (ADR-002)
If no polygon: state awaiting_delimitation (ASM-027). If polygon exists: state confirming;
plans confirmation mission with focus coordinates in campaign or extra flight (ASM-026)

19. Case reaching confirmed triggers Order Service to create draft Fumigation Order:
Fields: {order_id, farm_id, plot_id, reason: case_id + focus_confirmed result, polygon_version}
Guard: Plot has active polygon and confirmation record is closed (ASM-142). State: draft.
